    content .= "3. Select a Guide: Click on a specific shortcut guide (e.g., 'Windows Shortcut commands', 'Excel Shortcut commands').`n"
    content .= "4. View Shortcuts: A window will appear displaying the relevant keyboard shortcuts for your selection.`n"
    content .= "5. Close Guide: Click the 'Close' button or press the Escape key to close the shortcut guide window.`n`n"
